g-[0.3em] text-brand-900 md:px-12\">GOOD ANGEL</span><span class=\"text-lg text-brand-900/40\">✦</span></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"px-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-900 md:px-12\">REAL ESTATE</span><span class=\"text-lg text-brand-900/40\">✦</span></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"px-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-900 md:px-12\">FINANCE</span><span class=\"text-lg text-brand-900/40\">✦</span></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"px-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-900 md:px-12\">GROWTH</span><span class=\"text-lg text-brand-900/40\">✦</span></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"px-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-900 md:px-12\">TOGETHER</span><span class=\"text-lg text-brand-900/40\">✦</span></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-paper py-24 text-brand-900 md:py-32\"><div class=\"container-shell\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">OUR FOUNDATION</p><h2 class=\"mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-6xl\">成長不是一句<br/><span class=\"text-brand-500\">口號。</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"group border-t border-brand-900/15 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:odd:border-r\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-gold\">01</span><span class=\"translate-x-2 text-brand-900/20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗︎</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold\">不動產實務</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">從市場理解到實務應用，建立真正能帶走的專業能力。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-t border-brand-900/15 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:odd:border-r\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-gold\">02</span><span class=\"translate-x-2 text-brand-900/20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗︎</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold\">財商教育</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">理解資產、風險與選擇，建立更完整的財務思維。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-t border-brand-900/15 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:odd:border-r\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-gold\">03</span><span class=\"translate-x-2 text-brand-900/20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗︎</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold\">人才培育</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">透過學習、陪伴與實戰，讓每一位夥伴找到成長方向。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-t border-brand-900/15 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:odd:border-r\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-gold\">04</span><span class=\"translate-x-2 text-brand-900/20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗︎</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold\">團隊共好</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">我們相信長期價值，來自一群願意彼此成就的人。</p><div class=\"mt-8 h-px w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></article></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 py-24 text-ivory md:py-36\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 top-10 select-none text-[22rem] font-semibold leading-none text-white/[0.015]\">03</div><div class=\"container-shell relative\"><div class=\"mb-20 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div><p class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">WHAT WE DO</p><h2 class=\"mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-6xl\">三個核心，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-200\">一個成長方向。</span></h2></div><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">從專業知識到實際應用，好天使希望建立的不只是能力， 而是一套能持續累積的成長方式。</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/15\"><article class=\"group relative grid gap-6 border-b border-white/15 py-10 transition-colors duration-500 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center md:py-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-white/[0.035] transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><p class=\"relative font-serif text-5xl text-gold\">01</p><div class=\"relative\"><p class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-white/35\">REAL ESTATE</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold md:text-3xl\">不動產實務</h3></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">從市場判讀、物件理解到實際交易情境，建立能真正應用於市場的專業能力。</p><span class=\"text-2xl text-gold transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid gap-6 border-b border-white/15 py-10 transition-colors duration-500 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center md:py-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-white/[0.035] transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><p class=\"relative font-serif text-5xl text-gold\">02</p><div class=\"relative\"><p class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-white/35\">FINANCIAL EDUCATION</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold md:text-3xl\">財商教育</h3></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">從資產配置、財務觀念與風險理解出發，培養做出長期選擇的思考能力。</p><span class=\"text-2xl text-gold transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid gap-6 border-b border-white/15 py-10 transition-colors duration-500 md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_1fr] md:items-center md:py-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-white/[0.035] transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><p class=\"relative font-serif text-5xl text-gold\">03</p><div class=\"relative\"><p class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-white/35\">TALENT GROWTH</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold md:text-3xl\">人才培育</h3></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">我們不只提供知識，更透過團隊、制度與實戰，陪伴每一位夥伴持續成長。</p><span class=\"text-2xl text-gold transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-ivory text-brand-900\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-8 top-12 select-none text-[clamp(8rem,22vw,24rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.08em] text-brand-900/[0.025]\">ABOUT</div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr] lg:gap-24\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">ABOUT GOOD ANGEL</p></div><h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-md text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">不只是學習，<br/>更是<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 成長系統。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">不動產 × 財商 × 人才培育</p><div class=\"relative mt-12 min-h-[640px] overflow-hidden lg:min-h-[720px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><img alt=\"好天使團隊交流與學習\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] hover:scale-[1.025]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 36vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/10\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900/60 via-brand-900/10 to-transparent px-6 pb-6 pt-20\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-ivory\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.24em]\">GOOD ANGEL · TAICHUNG</p><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 hidden items-end gap-4 lg:flex\"><span class=\"font-serif text-7xl font-light leading-none text-gold\">03</span><span class=\"pb-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-900/35\">CORE FIELDS</span></div></div></div><div><div class=\"border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><h3 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.035em] md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.22]\">我們不只分享知識，<br/>更希望陪伴每一位夥伴<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 建立自己的專業。</span></h3><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg md:leading-9\">好天使不動產財商團隊結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 透過學習、交流與實務經驗的累積，讓不同背景的夥伴逐步理解產業， 建立判斷能力，也找到屬於自己的成長方向。</p></div><div class=\"mt-16 border-t border-brand-900/15\"><article class=\"group relative border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:py-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-brand-900/[0.025] transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><div class=\"relative grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[110px_1fr_1.2fr] md:items-center\"><div><p class=\"font-serif text-5xl font-light text-gold\">01</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[8px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/35\">REAL ESTATE</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600 md:text-3xl\">不動產實務</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">從市場資訊、物件分析到實際購屋流程，在真實案例中逐步建立對不動產市場的理解與判斷能力。</p><span class=\"hidden text-2xl text-gold transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:block\">→</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:py-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-brand-900/[0.025] transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><div class=\"relative grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[110px_1fr_1.2fr] md:items-center\"><div><p class=\"font-serif text-5xl font-light text-gold\">02</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[8px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/35\">FINANCIAL LITERACY</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600 md:text-3xl\">財商思維</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">理解稅務、資產配置與財務規劃的基本邏輯，把零散的知識轉化成能實際運用的專業能力。</p><span class=\"hidden text-2xl text-gold transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:block\">→</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:py-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-brand-900/[0.025] transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><div class=\"relative grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[110px_1fr_1.2fr] md:items-center\"><div><p class=\"font-serif text-5xl font-light text-gold\">03</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[8px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/35\">PROFESSIONAL GROWTH</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600 md:text-3xl\">專業成長</h3></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-8\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">透過團隊交流、經驗分享與持續學習，在累積實務經驗的同時，探索適合自己的職涯發展方向。</p><span class=\"hidden text-2xl text-gold transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:block\">→</span></div></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-8 border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-12 md:grid-cols-[0.35fr_1.65fr]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.28em] text-gold\">OUR PURPOSE</p><div><p class=\"max-w-4xl text-xl font-medium leading-[1.75] md:text-3xl md:leading-[1.65]\">我們相信，一個人的起點不代表終點。<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> <!-- -->願意學習、願意累積、願意與團隊一起前進，</span>就有機會走出自己的專業道路。</p><div class=\"mt-10 h-px w-full overflow-hidden bg-brand-900/10\"><div class=\"h-full bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 py-8 md:py-12\"><div class=\"container-shell\"><div class=\"relative h-[75vh] min-h-[620px] overflow-hidden\" style=\"clip-path:inset(8% 6% 8% 6%)\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-y-[12%] inset-x-0\" style=\"transform:translateY(-8%)\"><img alt=\"好天使團隊共同學習與交流\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/20\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[70%] bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900 via-brand-900/50 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-[55%] bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-900/70 to-transparent\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.35) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.35) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:72px 72px\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-7 top-7 z-10 md:right-10 md:top-10\"><p class=\"font-serif text-5xl font-light text-gold md:text-7xl\">01</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-right text-[8px] tracking-[0.3em] text-white/40\">VISION</p></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-7 right-7 z-10 md:bottom-14 md:left-12 md:right-12 lg:bottom-16 lg:left-16\" style=\"transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><span class=\"h-px w-10 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">BUILD YOUR FUTURE</p></div><h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-5xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.045em] text-white md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\">不只是看見機會，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-200\">更要有能力走向它。</span></h2><div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-t border-white/20 pt-6 md:flex-row md:items-end\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-white/55 md:text-base md:leading-8\">專業來自持續理解市場、累積經驗， 也來自一群願意分享知識、彼此成就的夥伴。</p><p class=\"text-[8px] tracking-[0.28em] text-white/35\">GOOD ANGEL / TAICHUNG</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-paper text-brand-900\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -left-8 top-24 select-none text-[clamp(8rem,20vw,22rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.08em] text-brand-900/[0.025]\">GROW</div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-24\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></span><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">WHY GOOD ANGEL</p></div><h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-md text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">從加入，<br/>到成為<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 更好的自己。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base\">Learning · Practice<br/>Teamwork · Growth</p><div class=\"mt-14 hidden lg:block\"><div class=\"flex items-end gap-4\"><span class=\"font-serif text-7xl font-light leading-none text-gold\">04</span><span class=\"pb-2 text-[9px] tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-900/35\">GROWTH STAGES</span></div><div class=\"mt-8 h-px max-w-[220px] bg-brand-900/10\"><div class=\"h-full bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><h3 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.035em] md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.2]\">一份工作的價值，<br/>不只在今天做了什麼，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-600\">也在明天成為什麼樣的人。</span></h3><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg md:leading-9\">我們重視知識的累積，也重視實務經驗與團隊交流。 在好天使，每一次學習與參與，都能成為建立專業能力的一部分。</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-20\"><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[27px] top-0 w-px bg-brand-900/10 md:left-[39px]\"><div class=\"w-full bg-gold\" style=\"height:0px\"></div></div><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">01</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">LEARNING</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">從學習開始</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">透過不動產、財商與市場相關知識的累積，逐步建立對產業的理解，讓專業不是背答案，而是真的知道如何判斷。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">02</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">PRACTICE</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">從實務累積經驗</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">把學到的觀念帶進真實案例與工作情境，在一次次接觸與討論中，累積屬於自己的實務經驗。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">03</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">TEAMWORK</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">和團隊一起前進</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">透過交流、經驗分享與彼此協作，讓遇到的問題不必只靠自己摸索，也讓不同背景的經驗能彼此成為養分。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article><article class=\"group relative grid min-h-[260px] grid-cols-[56px_1fr] border-t border-brand-900/15 py-12 md:min-h-[320px] md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr] md:py-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-brand-900/15 bg-paper transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-gold group-hover:bg-brand-900 md:h-20 md:w-20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-gold transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-ivory md:text-2xl\">04</span></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-7 md:pl-12\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">GROWTH</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 md:text-4xl\">找到自己的發展方向</h3><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-muted md:text-base md:leading-8\">在持續學習與實務累積的過程中，更了解自己的能力與興趣，逐步探索適合自己的專業與職涯方向。</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-20\"></span><span class=\"translate-x-[-8px] text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/30 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">KEEP GROWING</span></div></div></article></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-12 left-0 select-none whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(7rem,18vw,18rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.07em] text-white/[0.025]\">JOIN US</div><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-px w-full origin-left bg-gold/60\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-end\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">GROW WITH US</p><h3 class=\"mt-7 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">我們尋找的，<br/>不只是已經<span class=\"text-brand-200\"> 準備好的人。</span></h3></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-white/55\">比起一開始就什麼都會，我們更期待願意理解產業、持續學習， 並且願意與團隊共同累積經驗的夥伴。</p><a class=\"group mt-10 inline-flex min-w-[220px] items-center justify-between bg-[#c7d98f] px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#dbe8b4]\" href=\"/career\"><span>加入好天使</span><span class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-ivory text-brand-900\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 select-none text-[clamp(10rem,28vw,30rem)] font-semibold leading-none text-brand-900/[0.018]\">GA</div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-28 md:py-40 lg:py-52\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></span><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">OUR BELIEF</p></div><p class=\"hidden text-[8px] tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-900/30 sm:block\">GOOD ANGEL © 2026</p></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl md:mt-28\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"text-[clamp(2.5rem,6.5vw,6.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em] text-brand-900\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(110%)\">真正的專業，</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"text-[clamp(2.5rem,6.5vw,6.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em] text-brand-900\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(110%)\">不只是知道答案，</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"text-[clamp(2.5rem,6.5vw,6.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em] text-brand-600\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(110%)\">而是知道如何</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"text-[clamp(2.5rem,6.5vw,6.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em] text-brand-600\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(110%)\">做出判斷。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-20 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-7 md:mt-28 md:flex-row md:items-start\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"max-w-lg text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">從知識到實務，從個人成長到團隊合作， 我們希望每一次累積，都能讓下一次選擇更加清楚。</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-gold\">∞</span><p class=\"text-[8px] leading-5 tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/35\">KEEP LEARNING<br/>KEEP GROWING</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"team\" class=\"overflow-hidden bg-ivory text-brand-900\"><div class=\"container-shell py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></span><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">OUR PEOPLE</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">People · Knowledge<br/>Collaboration · Growth</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><h2 class=\"max-w-5xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">每一份專業背後，<br/>都是一群願意<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 一起前進的人。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg md:leading-9\">好天使匯聚不同經驗與專業背景的夥伴。我們相信，好的團隊不是每個人都一樣， 而是讓不同能力彼此交流、互相學習，一起把事情做好。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto h-[70vh] min-h-[560px] max-h-[900px] w-full overflow-hidden\" style=\"clip-path:inset(10% 8% 10% 8%)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"transform:scale(1.1)\"><img alt=\"好天使團隊文化\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/20\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-2/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900 via-brand-900/35 to-transparent\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.3) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.3) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:80px 80px\"></div><div class=\"container-shell absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-10 pb-10 md:pb-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-t border-white/25 pt-6 md:flex-row md:items-end\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">TOGETHER WE GROW</p><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-2xl font-medium leading-[1.4] text-white md:text-4xl\">不只是一起工作，<br/>也是一起變得更好。</p></div><p class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.28em] text-white/50\">GOOD ANGEL / TEAM CULTURE</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container-shell py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"mb-16 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-10 md:flex-row md:items-end\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">MEET THE PEOPLE</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-5xl\">認識我們的夥伴</h3></div><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">不同背景、不同經驗，在同一個團隊裡分享彼此的專業與觀點。</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-x-6 gap-y-16 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:gap-x-8\"><article class=\"group \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(70px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PORTRAIT</p><p class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-6xl text-brand-900/10\">01</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/0 transition-colors duration-700 group-hover:bg-brand-900/10\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(48,75,53,.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(48,75,53,.5) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:48px 48px\"></div><span class=\"absolute left-5 top-5 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/40\">01</span><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-11 w-11 translate-y-3 items-center justify-center bg-brand-900 text-ivory opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[3px] w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-8 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">不動產實務與財商專業</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1\">核心團隊</h3></div><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-900/30\">GA /<!-- -->01</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">結合不動產市場經驗與財商思維，透過實務交流與案例分享，陪伴夥伴逐步建立自己的專業判斷能力。</p></div></article><article class=\"group lg:translate-y-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(70px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PORTRAIT</p><p class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-6xl text-brand-900/10\">02</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/0 transition-colors duration-700 group-hover:bg-brand-900/10\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(48,75,53,.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(48,75,53,.5) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:48px 48px\"></div><span class=\"absolute left-5 top-5 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/40\">02</span><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-11 w-11 translate-y-3 items-center justify-center bg-brand-900 text-ivory opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[3px] w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-8 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">學習交流與成長陪伴</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1\">專業夥伴</h3></div><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-900/30\">GA /<!-- -->02</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">來自不同背景與專業領域，在團隊協作、經驗分享與持續學習中彼此交流，一起累積屬於好天使的專業能力。</p></div></article></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#c7d98f]\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-10 left-0 whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(8rem,20vw,20rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.07em] text-brand-900/[0.035]\">TOGETHER</div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.55fr_1.45fr] lg:gap-20\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-900/60\" style=\"opacity:0\">OUR CULTURE</p><div><h3 class=\"max-w-5xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-6xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\">專業不是<br/>一個人的表現，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-700\">而是一群人一起累積的結果。</span></h3><div class=\"mt-12 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-t border-brand-900/20 pt-8 md:flex-row md:items-end\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-brand-900/65\">我們重視彼此分享經驗、交換觀點，也保留每個人發展自己專業方向的空間。 在這裡，學習不只是課程，而是每天與不同夥伴合作時持續發生的事情。</p><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-brand-900\" href=\"/team\"><span>認識團隊</span><span class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" c